# =====================================================================
# Claude Code
# =====================================================================
# The .claude/ development kit IS shipped — it is how a clone of this repo
# inherits the 2plot network's behavioral contract, skills, and settings
# (template 1.6.15, the F1 fabric build). This repo blanket-ignored the whole
# folder from its first commit, which is why the contract stayed local-only:
# nothing here propagated to anyone who cloned it.
#
# Allow-list, not blanket ignore — a dir-level ignore cannot be re-included
# beneath it, hence the /* form. Everything NOT listed stays local: this
# repo's own agents/, rules/, scripts/, tasks/, support_files/, context.md,
# the setup script, session scratch, screenshots, and settings.local.json
# (per-seat model and hook overrides).
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/

# Session working documents are LOCAL BY CONVENTION, network-wide: sync
# reports, handoffs and kickoff briefs name hosts, topology and process. Two
# public fleet repos were caught tracking theirs (2026-08-24). This repo was
# one of them — X402-SYNC-REPORT.md was tracked from the gate-wave pass until
# the kit-adoption round untracked it, 2026-08-25.
#
# DEPLOY-READINESS.md is deliberately NOT in this list and stays tracked: it
# is an owner deliverable naming variable NAMES and dashboard STEPS, never a
# value. Recorded in DIVERGENCES.md.
X402-SYNC-REPORT.md
HANDOFF-*.md
KICKOFF-*.md

