# Generated component bundle output
#
# NOTE: `dash_excalidraw/dash_excalidraw.js` is deliberately TRACKED, not
# ignored. The release workflow gates on `git log -1 --format=%ct` against
# that path; for an untracked file that expands to an empty string and the
# comparison is a bash syntax error, not a skipped check. Tracking it also
# keeps `pip install git+...` and `pip install -e .` working without npm.
# Rebuild and commit the bundle only in release-prep commits.
dash_excalidraw/dash_excalidraw.js.map

# `dash-generate-components` byproduct. Not shipped in the wheel, and CI
# asserts it is absent from the built artifact.
dash_excalidraw/metadata.json

